What:           /sys/devices/omapdss/display0/gamma_profile
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Select the LU5400 panel gamma base curve at runtime.
                0: original LG factory curve (default after boot).
                1: custom curve retaining the LG weighted tone shape with
                   R98%, G87%, B100% gains (8-bit white: 250,222,255).

                2: linear identity curve without base color correction.

                Accepts decimal 0, 1 or 2; other values fail. Updates the active
                LCD at VSYNC without reboot. Selection survives panel power
                cycling but is not persisted by the kernel across reboot.
                The device settings boot receiver restores the saved UI selection.

                Existing gamma_tuning RGB gains multiply the
                selected curve. Use 255,255,255 to compare base profiles.
                Requires the P2 gamma and runtime calibration options.
